		"description": "<p>(1/Safe Rest) Free Reaction: When an ally you can see is reduced to 0 HP. The ally is instead reduced to 1 HP. Additionally, all allies that can hear you gain LVL temp HP, 1 minute.</p><hr><p><em>[A] The 1/Safe Rest use is a counter on this feature (a Free Reaction). When an allied hero drops to 0 HP while the use is there, your owner is asked: use it and the ally is set to 1 HP (Dying removed), the card's LVL temp HP goes to the allies you pick, with an Undo card.</em></p><p><em>[M] The temp HP lasts 1 minute: remove what is left by hand.</em></p>",
